[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3721.109, "timestamp": "01:02:01", "text": "你的力量来自星座和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3724.63, "timestamp": "01:02:04", "text": "夜空。等等，那其实是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3727.27, "timestamp": "01:02:07", "text": "等等，DND里的星辰德鲁伊是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3729.51, "timestamp": "01:02:09", "text": "一个以星空为主题的施法者，他的力量来自星座和夜空"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3731.91, "timestamp": "01:02:11", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3735.589, "timestamp": "01:02:15", "text": "现在，他现在，他现在，他现在真的很喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3737.67, "timestamp": "01:02:17", "text": "这个角色，因为他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3741.67, "timestamp": "01:02:21", "text": "现在知道这个角色是做什么的了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3744.23, "timestamp": "01:02:24", "text": "他玩的时候完全不知道。我刚才说谁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3745.91, "timestamp": "01:02:25", "text": "主持来着？我忘了是谁了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3746.87, "timestamp": "01:02:26", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3753.99, "timestamp": "01:02:33", "text": "如果他正在看这个，就狠狠地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3756.23, "timestamp": "01:02:36", "text": "骂他一顿，你知道，就像欺负"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3758.47, "timestamp": "01:02:38", "text": "他一样。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3765.27, "timestamp": "01:02:45", "text": "现在正在给第二组主持一个环节。我想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3767.109, "timestamp": "01:02:47", "text": "一个地下城主，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3770.71, "timestamp": "01:02:50", "text": "大多数人一样。是的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3774.39, "timestamp": "01:02:54", "text": "昨天的小组是第一组。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3775.92, "timestamp": "01:02:55", "text": "第一组。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3776.72, "timestamp": "01:02:56", "text": "嗯， 那仍然很酷。 那挺酷的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3779.44, "timestamp": "01:02:59", "text": "那仍然很酷。 那挺酷的。 是啊，我是侦察队探索"}]